Read a file by path, or load an enabled skill in full by exact name. Pass exactly one of file_path or skill_name. file_path returns line numbers, supports offset and line limit (default {{ .DefaultReadLimit }}, max {{ .MaxViewSizeKB }}KB returned file content section), and renders images (PNG, JPEG, GIF, WebP). skill_name returns the complete skill body plus the location it came from, and does not accept offset or limit. Use ls for directories.
